      "writtenOn": "2023-03-10T09:03:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that we can totally accept these type of patches in special cases. For instance if they are fixing a launch-blocker bug of some kind and we can\u0027t afford to wait for the LTS merge to land. If that is the case here please let us know via the bug, but if not, getting this lot via stable is probably the best way forward indeed. Cheers!",
      "parentUuid": "b468fc4d_2f5fb1bf",
      "revId": "546b12fed19982d354e86cc384108b9d720e16eb",
